---
// The forest at dusk. The sky is the logo's gradient (ink -> violet ->
// magenta -> coral -> ember) and every treeline takes the colour of the air
// in front of it, so depth comes from the logo palette. Scrolling walks you
// down the clearing in the middle: src/scripts/forest.ts eases scroll into
// --p (0 -> 1) and the pointer into --mx; forest.css does the rest.
// Treelines are tileable SVGs in public/forest/, generated from code.
---

<section id="home" class="f-hero" data-f-hero aria-labelledby="f-hero-title">
  <div class="f-hero__stage">
    <div class="f-scene" aria-hidden="true">
